<title>SINGAPORE: Petronas Malacca refinery to shut for maintenance.</title>
<headline>Petronas Malacca refinery to shut for maintenance.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian state-owned Petroliam Nasional Bhd (Petronas) plans to shut its 100,000 barrel-per-day (bpd) refinery in Malacca for maintenance from December 1-10, an official source said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
